    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549730/extras/5bdcb8ef4a2b0031a457869737efce2a.avif?t=1755500037\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong>: Take down swarms of aliens with quick reflexes and calculated precision. Chain kills into streaks to earn extra points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: Fully voiced 3D cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong>: A symphonic score for the intro and ending, and aggresive synths in-gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two endings</strong>: Earn 20,000 points or more (or complete the game in Ace difficulty) and unlock the secret ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong>: Diverse alien species, each with unique flight patterns, attacks, and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong>: Test your mettle against powerful alien bosses that demand your best dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong>:\u00a0Three modes that adapt the challenge for every player, from story focused to pure suffering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun achievements</strong>: Unlock them by exploiting enemy mechanics.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549730/extras/5bdcb8ef4a2b0031a457869737efce2a.avif?t=1755500037\" data-has-big width=800 height=322 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced combat</strong>: Take down swarms of aliens with quick reflexes and calculated precision. Chain kills into streaks to earn extra points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: Fully voiced 3D cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong>: A symphonic score for the intro and ending, and aggresive synths in-gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two endings</strong>: Earn 20,000 points or more (or complete the game in Ace difficulty) and unlock the secret ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong>: Diverse alien species, each with unique flight patterns, attacks, and behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong>: Test your mettle against powerful alien bosses that demand your best dodging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong>:\u00a0Three modes that adapt the challenge for every player, from story focused to pure suffering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun achievements</strong>: Unlock them by exploiting enemy mechanics.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Blood Aliens 3 is a cinematic, story-driven space shooter where every alien wave burns hope into defiance.",
